// ================================================================
// VDO_Rec_Conversation.yarn — only the conversations of DEMO_3Days.yarn, for
// recording video: every character line and every player choice, no orders or
// cocktails. Positions, cameras and expressions are the demo's.
//
// Run: on [GameLoop] › FlowWiring set Day Schedule to DaySchedule_VDO_Conversation,
//      Play, and turn AutoPlay ON so lines advance by themselves. Each choice shows
//      its buttons; the first one (#timeout) is picked by itself after the option
//      presenter's Auto Select Duration (10 s), or click any to pick it sooner.
//
// Generated from DEMO_3Days.yarn (2026-10-30): node names get a VC_ prefix, order
// nodes are left out, the day ends become a fade into the next day.
// ================================================================

