//Walter greeting
Walter: Good evening.[waitfor=0.2/] It's been a long time since I last saw someone open something new in this town. #line:0d81256 
Walter: You must be the new face in town. #line:0118924 
-> Welcome #timeout #line:07c744d 
    Player: Good evening, welcome to the bar. #line:03d8b66 
    Player: Please, take your time and make yourself comfortable. #line:01592af 
-> Honest #line:0fa2866 
    Player: Yes, I just opened tonight. #line:08fb693 
    Player: Still trying to get used to how quiet this town is. #line:08da72d 
-> Friendly #line:0344ee8 
    Player: Really? I thought I've been running this place since the 20th century. #line:04cc9fd 
    Walter: [wiggle]Haha... quite a talker.[/wiggle] #line:09648c3 
-> Formal #line:00a1fda 
    Player: Welcome. It's a pleasure to have you as my first guest. #line:0710780 

Walter: I'm Walter, by the way. #line:0422038 
Player: Nice to meet you Mr. Walter. #line:0e7e4d1 
Player: You can call me bartender. #line:02379c0 
Walter: Normally at this hour, I'd just be sitting in front of the TV. #line:0630709 
Walter: [dangle]Old habits, I suppose.[/dangle] #line:0e734ee 
Walter: But I saw a new place opening up, so I thought I'd drop by. #line:053a5a8 
